<title>USA: Oxboro Medical CEO Haase leaves post.</title>
<headline>Oxboro Medical CEO Haase leaves post.</headline>
<dateline>HAM LAKE, Minn. 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oxboro Medical International Inc on Friday said Harley Haase will no longer serve as the company's president and chief executive officer.</p>
<p>Larry Rasmusson, chairman and chief financial officer, will assume the duties of chief executive, the company said. Company officials were not available to comment on the personnel shift.</p>
<p>Haase provide services as a consultant, the company said.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
